{"id": "DXY3yRzEXxY", "title": "Video by visionmachina", "description": "This entire project took us 3 months from start to end. An AI video. Taking 3 months? Really?\n\nSpec ads and real client work are two completely different games.\n\nThe moment an agency and a real client are in the room, everything slows down and it should. More people, more precision, more at stake. That’s the hard part nobody posting their AI reels wants to talk about.\n\nStoryboards. Character sheets. Location sheets. Revision after revision. Then the actual generation, the edit, the grade, the sound design.\n\nMaking a good image or a good video isn’t the job. The job is making it land, not just for you, but for every person attached to it.\n\nThat’s the agency mindset. That’s the bar.\n\nThanks @grab_sg for trusting in us!! Looking forward to more exciting collaborations 💚💚", "channel": "visionmachina", "uploader_id": "71483437226", "uploader": "VISION MACHINA", "timestamp": 1776764085, "like_count": 57, "comment_count": 0, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2144370633021212a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 67.42, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPsM4dyrdY9YPjqLZMYS63l_KK6OqCviQSKk99mLLtDOTpuW8-syIxWeevNMiVuwSEC94nfRFz9qOa_FW-3xgOU-GpScaES0wuFpzM.mp4?_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=AdptB09E0IYbu-PV8-noT6TWIFZEzGrIx8JwDeGqiJ7jbdioPslVoOeHRvqqfMob1KDGAv5Cd3D2YI87B9BBQb3Y&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=vLzx5dZsqLgQ7kNvwGqZPdz&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=3rjUYjd-wtOmGYUdEealIg&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQTcneb_yTgH9PFc9ws7qIq-16v15Tr6XQjl8ydJETUkVA&oe=6AF426FB", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 67.42, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0